abstract: >
  UET unifies classical and quantum physics by treating entropy and information as the fundamental coupling mechanism ($\beta$) between energy and spacetime geometry. By modeling mass as Information Drag, UET provides a predictive solution to the Galaxy Rotation and Hubble Tension anomalies without requiring Dark Matter or Dark Energy.
